    <section id="about" class="about">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cardimg about">
                <img src="img/kilogram.png" alt="Chopvibe Studio">
            </div>
            <div class="cardtext about">
                <h2>Feel the Vibe. Savor The Sound.</h2>
                <p>CV Group is a creative powerhouse based in Akure, Nigeria, sitting at the intersection of technology and entertainment. Founded on the principle of "Chopvibe" we integrate world-class software engineering with cutting-edge music production to fuel the next generation of African creators and businesses.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="fest">
        
        <div class="container">	
            <div class="cardtext fest">
			<h2 class="center-text">ChopVibe Fest</h2>
                <h3>The Pulse of the Street. The Soul of the Stage.</h3>
                <p>Chopvibe Fest was born from a single mission: to take the unfiltered talent of the 
				underground and amplify it with world-class production. It is more than an outdoor festival; 
				it is the official birth of the Chopvibe Record Label and a sanctuary for those who live for 
				the rhythm of the city.</p>
				
				<ol><li><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar"></i> December 2026</li>
					<li> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>Nationwide</li>
					<li> <i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> Starting From #3000</li>
				</ol>
                <button class="btn">Get Tickets</button>
            </div>
			
            <div class="cardimg fest">
                <!-- Direct image link fixed -->
                <img src="img/ajebo.png" alt="Upcoming Event">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="artists" class="section-artist">
        <h2 class="center-text">The Roster</h2>
        <div class="artist-grid" id="artistGrid"></div>
    </section>
	
    <section id="services" class="gallery">
        <h2 class="center-text">Gallery</h2>
